<title>POLAND: Polish LOT, AA start code-share flights to LA, Miami.</title>
<headline>Polish LOT, AA start code-share flights to LA, Miami.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish national air carrier LOT will begin code-sharing flights to Los Angeles and Miami on September 16 with the U.S.'s American Airlines, PAP news agency reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The agreement envisions code-sharing arrangements to ten American cities between the two firms within a year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
